{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic puzzle where attention, logic, and speed work as a team. Each level is a new challenge: find your way out of tangled mazes, collect the necessary elements, search for hidden details, move objects, and match the right colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on constant variety: sometimes a quick reaction test, sometimes a thoughtful task where strategy matters. No repetitions here\u2014each level reveals an unusual format and requires finding a solution where it seems impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Levels for attentiveness, reaction, and logic <br>\ud83e\udde9 Combination of genres: from puzzles to dynamic mini-games <br>\ud83c\udf1f Bright and diverse visual design <br>\u23f3 Short rounds that easily draw you in <br>\ud83d\udd11 Simple mechanics, but engaging from the first minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976510?t=1757513969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976510/daa4138eae3b24b258a23bd57105788a16d19279/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757513969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976510/22fd5e299ff66416038a53daede12d5925accfc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757513969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976510/22fd5e299ff66416038a53daede12d5925accfc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757513969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dy